version 3
name "OutlinerMenu"
id_counter 150
description "Keeps the Outliner's row menu current: its heading names the selection, Break When Spawned shows whether the selection's prototype breaks, and the Live and object items follow the run; sets the eye's Alt+click tip for the platform."
owner_type "ecs.entity"
